\">[</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,]</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;A&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> <br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">[</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">2</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,]</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;B&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> <br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">[</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">3</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,]</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;C&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> <br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">[</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#006666\">4</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">,]</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#008800\">&quot;D&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>But the actual ouput order on the y-axis are, fom ymin to ymax: D, C, A, B<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:#fafafa\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:#666600\">nwk.tree.ggtree &lt;- ggtree(nwk.tree) + geom_tiplab()<br>\r\nnwk.tree.ggtree</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/5660a25aec78/ggtree_tip_lab_order.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1&amp;authuser=0\" alt=\"ggtree_tip_lab_order.png\" width=\"137\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\"></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:normal\">How can I access this output order from the nwk.tree.ggtree (or the nwk.tree) ?<span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\"><br>\r\n</span><br>Many thanks in advance, <br><br>Rémi</p>\r\n\r\n</div></blockquote></div>"
